      "raw": "<p>I get the same problem, on Steam on my PC. Tried reinstalling, and that did nothing. Moreover when hitting enter I still start a custom game but only base heroes, villains, and environment cards are shown (I got every expansion). After hitting the team/normal button all my heroes and villains show up again, but not the environments.</p><p><br /><strong>EDIT&nbsp;</strong>It&#39;s even worse than I thought, when I joined another Custom game I got to choose hero, but then when they started the game I was stuck on the hero selection screen even when it started the game for the other two heroes. We could all chat in game and everything, but that was it. Restarting the game just kicked me out of the game altogether.</p><p><strong>EDIT2&nbsp;</strong>Well I can now join other&#39;s games and play thankfully, seemed to be a one time deal. I also found a way around creating a game and hosting it by pressing the large comic book shaped button &quot;new game&quot; instead of clicking &quot;custom game&quot;. I still wish my game would work properly again :(</p>",
